    <li>零件工厂群</li>
  </DMS_FT2_StampingPlant.tierLabels>

  <!-- EN: artiprotein vats -->
  <DMS_FT2_ArtiproteinVats.label>人造蛋白槽</DMS_FT2_ArtiproteinVats.label>
  <!-- EN: Cultures artificial protein independent of soil and weather. Taxes can send artiprotein home. -->
  <DMS_FT2_ArtiproteinVats.description>培养人造蛋白，不受土壤与天候影响。税收可将人造蛋白送回殖民地。</DMS_FT2_ArtiproteinVats.description>
