  <!-- EN: synthetic fibre mill -->
  <DMS_FT2_SyntheticFibreMill.label>化纤纺织厂</DMS_FT2_SyntheticFibreMill.label>
  <!-- EN: Spins polyester and, with spacer technology, plasfiber for uniforms and webbing. Taxes can send fabric home. -->
  <DMS_FT2_SyntheticFibreMill.description>纺制聚酯纤维，具备太空科技后亦可生产等离子纤维，供军服与织带使用。税收可将布料送回殖民地。</DMS_FT2_SyntheticFibreMill.description>
